A precision train simulation system that integrates with Telefonica's cloud infrastructure to demonstrate real-time event visualization. The installation responds to actual cloud events including emergencies, load balancing, and system alerts through choreographed mechanical movement.

Key features included closed-loop stepper motor control, websocket cloud integration, redundant safety systems, and rapid 48-hour on-site deployment capability.

The system achieved zero downtime over 40+ operational hours at the exhibition, processing 2,800+ cloud events and demonstrating to over 10,000 visitors, including H.H. The King of Spain. Featured prominently in Telefonica's MWC presentations, the installation became a focal point for discussions about IoT, edge computing, and physical-digital integration.

